cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these reference outputs or the harness that generates them, please cite them as below."
type: dataset
title: "terrame-goldens: Reference Execution Outputs of the TerraME ca, sysdyn and logo Packages"
abstract: >-
  Reference execution outputs (goldens) of the models of the TerraME 2.0.1 packages
  (cellular automata of the ca package; sysdyn and logo to follow), with fixed package commits,
  seeds and SHA-256 hashes, and the harness that regenerates them in the terrame-docker image.
  They are used to verify the DisSModel extensions dissmodel-ca, dissmodel-sysdyn and
  dissmodel-abm against TerraME itself.
version: 0.1.0
references:
  - type: software
    title: "terrame-docker: TerraME and LuccME in a Docker image"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/profsergiocosta/terrame-docker"
  - type: software
    title: "ca: Cellular Automata package for TerraME"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/TerraME/ca"
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/LambdaGeo/terrame-goldens"
repository-code: "https://github.com/LambdaGeo/terrame-goldens"
keywords:
  - TerraME
  - cellular automata
  - golden data
  - verification
  - reproducibility
  - open science
authors:
